and synthetic task instances generated by ticklm_bench.tasks. It also covers
the original native-client integrations in src/temporal_bridge/claude_backend.py
and src/temporal_bridge/codex_backend.py used by this benchmark. It does not
relicense historical repository contents, third-party code, model weights,
provider catalogs, cited papers, or model-generated responses.

